{"track":"r","category":"기초 문법","level":2,"title":"윤년 판별","desc":"<p>윤년이면 <code>TRUE</code>를 돌려주는 <code>is_leap(year)</code>를 만드세요. 윤년은 <b>4로 나누어떨어지지만 100으로는 나누어떨어지지 않거나, 400으로 나누어떨어지는</b> 해예요.</p>","solution":"is_leap <- function(year) {\n  (year %% 4 == 0 && year %% 100 != 0) || year %% 400 == 0\n}\n","hint":"<p>R에서 단일 값 조건은 <code>&amp;&amp;</code>, <code>||</code> 를 써요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"is_leap(2000)","expected":true,"visible":true},{"call":"is_leap(1900)","expected":false,"visible":true},{"call":"is_leap(2024)","expected":true,"visible":false},{"call":"is_leap(2023)","expected":false,"visible":false},{"call":"is_leap(2100)","expected":false,"visible":false},{"call":"is_leap(1600)","expected":true,"visible":false}],"starter":"is_leap <- function(year) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-309"}